{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1374454-do-spirits-have-anything-for-piercing-illusion-magic-e-g-obf-chimer-mind-etc","id":1374454,"title":"Do Spirits have anything for piercing illusion magic (e.g.,Obf., Chimer, Mind, etc.)?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-12T16:59:01-07:00","id":1374454,"title":"Do Spirits have anything for piercing illusion magic (e.g.,Obf., Chimer, Mind, etc.)?","content":"There's certainly no &quot;Mind Shield&quot; or &quot;Illusion Pierce&quot; charm; and I've never seen a system for it. Also, it feels more than a little reductive and heavy-handed to just say &quot;compare level of power to Gnosis; the greater wins; if equal roll off Per+Subt v. Man+Subt&quot;. I suppose you could invent a Charm... but how would that work so that it's not garbage, or so OP that breaks any tension there might be in a &quot;can I/can't I&quot; analysis in trying to dupe the Spirit in question?<br /> <br /> Has anyone confronted this problem at their table and made a house rule they like? I'm all ears/eyes!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-13T17:44:58-07:00","id":1374665,"title":"","content":"I always just treated it as spirits being able to see through any such attempts unless it was a power whose description had specific fluff/rules for affecting them, or a magickal Effect that Included Spirit 2 or more to allow it to apply to non-corporeal beings.","signature":"